{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_036_gloria-title\">GLoRIA</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在全局图文对比之外，以词为 query 对 CNN region grid 做软 attention 并训练局部区域–词对齐。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Combines global image–report contrastive alignment with word-queried soft attention over local CNN image grid regions for fine-grained phrase grounding.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">医学图像与对应放射报告</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Medical image (chest X-ray) + paired free-text radiology report</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">全局图文对齐表征与局部区域–词语对齐特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Globally aligned image/text embeddings + word-grounded local spatial attention maps</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021/html/Huang_GLoRIA_A_Multimodal_Global-Local_Representation_Learning_Framework_for_Label-Efficient_Medical_ICCV_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_036_gloria')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_036_gloria')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"GLoRIA original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/5317d0a07401e62426fb.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_036_gloria\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_036_gloria')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_036_gloria\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">胸片图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Chest Radiograph</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">整幅 X-ray 输入视觉主干。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests medical image (chest x-ray) + paired free-text radiology report and prepares initial tensor representations (Chest Radiograph).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"整幅 X-ray 输入视觉主干。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests medical image (chest x-ray) + paired free-text radiology report and prepares initial tensor representations (Chest Radiograph).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"胸片图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Chest Radiograph\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">胸片图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Chest Radiograph</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">整幅 X-ray 输入视觉主干。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests medical image (chest x-ray) + paired free-text radiology report and prepares initial tensor representations (Chest Radiograph).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CNN 保留 H×W 空间特征，每个位置代表一个影像区域。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes local Region Grid to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"局部 Region Grid\" data-node-name-en=\"local Region Grid\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">局部 Region Grid</span><span class=\"lang-en\">local Region Grid</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CNN 保留 H×W 空间特征，每个位置代表一个影像区域。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes local Region Grid to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"region grid 经聚合得到检查级视觉表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs global vector within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"全局图像向量\" data-node-name-en=\"global vector\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局图像向量</span><span class=\"lang-en\">global vector</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">region grid 经聚合得到检查级视觉表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs global vector within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"报告分词后送入语言 encoder。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Tokens within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"报告 Tokens\" data-node-name-en=\"Tokens\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">报告 Tokens</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">报告分词后送入语言 encoder。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Tokens within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个报告 token/词保留上下文化表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs feature within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"词级特征\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">词级特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个报告 token/词保留上下文化表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs feature within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"报告序列聚合成检查级文本表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs global vector within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"全局文本向量\" data-node-name-en=\"global vector\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局文本向量</span><span class=\"lang-en\">global vector</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">报告序列聚合成检查级文本表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs global vector within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在 batch 内对比配对的全局图像和报告表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Global Alignment within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Global Alignment\" data-node-name-en=\"Global Alignment\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Global Alignment</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在 batch 内对比配对的全局图像和报告表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Global Alignment within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个词按相似度从所有视觉 regions 聚合其对应图像上下文。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs → Attention within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"词→区域 Attention\" data-node-name-en=\"→ Attention\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">词→区域 Attention</span><span class=\"lang-en\">→ Attention</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个词按相似度从所有视觉 regions 聚合其对应图像上下文。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs → Attention within the core global local image report alignment computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对齐词特征与其 attention 加权的局部视觉上下文。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Local Alignment to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Local Alignment\" data-node-name-en=\"Local Alignment\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Local Alignment</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对齐词特征与其 attention 加权的局部视觉上下文。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Local Alignment to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"联合目标后的特征支持少标签分类、检索和定位。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces globally aligned image/text embeddings + word-grounded local spatial attention maps via global + local representation.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"全局 + 局部表征\" data-node-name-en=\"global + local representation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_036_gloria', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局 + 局部表征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">global + local representation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">联合目标后的特征支持少标签分类、检索和定位。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces globally aligned image/text embeddings + word-grounded local spatial attention maps via global + local representation.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"GLoRIA Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · GLoRIA 由词语注意力汇聚对应影像区域</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Word-Attended Local Region Context Aggregation &amp; Local–Global Contrastive Loss</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"GLoRIA：核心公式 · GLoRIA 由词语注意力汇聚对应影像区域\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"36\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"27.049803pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.703264 -69.083544 175.781489 27.049803\" width=\"175.781489pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.632704-.95284L3.473897-1.052094C2.927999-.466495 2.540907-.248135 2.054562-.248135C1.488813-.248135 1.151349-.665003 1.151349-1.379633C1.151349-2.223294 1.498738-3.106656 2.054562-3.692256C2.342399-3.990019 2.739416-4.168676 3.136433-4.168676C3.364717-4.168676 3.503673-4.089273 3.503673-3.970168C3.503673-3.920541 3.493748-3.870914 3.444121-3.781585C3.374643-3.652554 3.354792-3.593002 3.354792-3.493748C3.354792-3.255538 3.503673-3.116582 3.741883-3.116582C4.019795-3.116582 4.218303-3.305165 4.218303-3.573151C4.218303-4.039646 3.781585-4.37711 3.176134-4.37711C1.687321-4.37711 .297763-2.927999 .297763-1.379633C.297763-.436718 .833735 .10918 1.756799 .10918C2.501206 .10918 3.027253-.188583 3.632704-.95284Z\" id=\"m036_g