xlink:href=\"#m036_g4-205\" y=\"-53.831488\"></use><use x=\"-33.38295\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g13-57\" y=\"-44.640976\"></use><use x=\"-28.468059\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g20-101\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"-24.393342\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g20-120\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"-19.412022\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g20-112\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"-13.932568\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g10-185\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"-10.375908\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g16-65\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"-5.753253\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g7-62\" y=\"-50.372459\"></use><use x=\"-5.01103\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g13-57\" y=\"-43.533572\"></use><use x=\".052572\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g16-70\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"7.473253\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g13-58\" y=\"-45.363274\"></use><use x=\"11.967727\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g10-157\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"16.680051\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g16-103\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"21.760998\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g10-186\" y=\"-46.857655\"></use><use x=\"26.772148\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g16-150\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"51.067648\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g16-50\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"56.176993\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g13-58\" y=\"-52.19763\"></use><use x=\"63.438799\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g1-61\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"72.542368\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g4-213\" y=\"-63.886266\"></use><use x=\"77.821749\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g13-56\" y=\"-42.347514\"></use><use x=\"87.453074\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g16-85\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"93.360924\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g13-56\" y=\"-52.19763\"></use><use x=\"96.310006\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g13-58\" y=\"-52.19763\"></use><use x=\"100.645076\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g16-65\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"104.919048\" xlink:href=\"#m036_g13-56\" y=\"-52.19763\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">global 图文 embedding 难定位细粒度征象</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Global image–report embeddings collapse spatial coordinates, failing to localize focal findings like small pneumothoraces or nodules.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">同时对齐整图-报告和局部影像区域-报告词语</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Align individual report words with attention-weighted combinations of local convolutional sub-regions alongside global study alignment.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">基于 attention 的 global-local contrastive objectives</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Joint global contrastive loss + word-to-region attention-weighted local contrastive objective without requiring bounding-box annotations.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">支持胸片检索、少标注分类/分割和 phrase grounding</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Enables zero-shot phrase grounding, text-to-image retrieval, and label-efficient chest X-ray segmentation/classification.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">开启医学 local grounding 主线；attention map 不等于因果解释</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Established local grounding in medical VLMs; soft attention heatmaps remain coarse and do not guarantee causal localization.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">全局对比保证一份报告与整幅影像语义匹配，局部对齐进一步把词语落到影像区域。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">词到区域 attention 是软对应，不需要边界框即可从报告学习潜在定位。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">局部和全局目标互补：前者保留细粒度病灶线索，后者稳定检查级语义。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Align individual report words with attention-weighted combinations of local convolutional sub-regions alongside global study alignment.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Joint global contrastive loss + word-to-region attention-weighted local contrastive objective without requiring bounding-box annotations.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Word-Attended Local Region Context Aggregation &amp; Local–Global Contrastive Loss.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可利用报告中的病灶词实现弱监督定位，但 attention 热图不是经过校准的病灶边界。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">否定、正常描述和非视觉性临床信息需在文本处理或评估中单独审计。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Enables zero-shot phrase grounding, text-to-image retrieval, and label-efficient chest X-ray segmentation/classification.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Established local grounding in medical VLMs; soft attention heatmaps remain coarse and do not guarantee causal localization.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2021/html/Huang_GLoRIA_A_Multimodal_Global-Local_Representation_Learning_Framework_for_Label-Efficient_Medical_ICCV_2021_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>GLoRIA: A Multimodal Global-Local Representation Learning Framework for Label-efficient Medical Image Recognition</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/marshuang80/gloria\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
